graph TD
  P[Plan written] --> G[Grill the plan<br/>numbered questions with recommended answers<br/>answers go into the plan file]
  G --> A{Approve the cut?<br/>name, risk, size, exercise line}
  A -- no --> G
  A -- yes, run.sh start<br/>hooks guard the run --> S1[Snapshot before the chunk]
  S1 --> I[Implementers, one per task<br/>model by risk, report ends with Proof]
  I --> SG{Static gate<br/>tsc, lint, tests, revert check}
  SG -- fails --> I
  SG -- clean, low risk --> REP
  SG -- clean --> R[Review against rubrics<br/>fix rounds, cap 3 or 5]
  R --> V[Verify seat<br/>runs the exercise line and criteria<br/>re-runs every Proof claim]
  V -- FAIL --> R
  V -- pass, high risk --> M[Cross-model review]
  M --> REP
  V -- pass --> REP[Chunk report<br/>Files, Changed, Proof, Verified, Fixed, Parked]
  REP --> W{Human says<br/>next / fix / redo / stop}
  W -- next --> S1
  W -- last chunk --> T[Verify every acceptance criterion]
  T --> TR[Whole-tree review, then cross-model]
  TR --> H[Hand off, run.sh stop<br/>working tree, nothing committed]
  W -- stop --> H
